[
  {
    "text": "Arby’s.",
    "startMs": 500,
    "endMs": 1610,
    "timestampMs": 500,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "R. B.",
    "startMs": 1710,
    "endMs": 3090,
    "timestampMs": 1710,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Roast beef.",
    "startMs": 3190,
    "endMs": 4500,
    "timestampMs": 3190,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "That sounds like a mystery solved.",
    "startMs": 4600,
    "endMs": 6840,
    "timestampMs": 4600,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Except those letters stand for something else.",
    "startMs": 6940,
    "endMs": 9720,
    "timestampMs": 6940,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "And once you learn the stories behind these four restaurant names,",
    "startMs": 9820,
    "endMs": 13410,
    "timestampMs": 9820,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "you might never read their signs quite the same way again.",
    "startMs": 13540,
    "endMs": 17020,
    "timestampMs": 13540,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Let’s start with the sandwich.",
    "startMs": 17120,
    "endMs": 19110,
    "timestampMs": 17120,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Picture a roast-beef sandwich beside two enormous letters.",
    "startMs": 19360,
    "endMs": 23180,
    "timestampMs": 19360,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "R and B.",
    "startMs": 23280,
    "endMs": 24580,
    "timestampMs": 23280,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Say them together.",
    "startMs": 24680,
    "endMs": 26110,
    "timestampMs": 24680,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "“Arby.”",
    "startMs": 26210,
    "endMs": 27290,
    "timestampMs": 26210,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "It’s such a convincing explanation that you barely have to think about it.",
    "startMs": 27390,
    "endMs": 31940,
    "timestampMs": 27390,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "But according to Arby’s parent company, the name refers to the Raffel Brothers:",
    "startMs": 32040,
    "endMs": 37018,
    "timestampMs": 32040,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Leroy and Forrest.",
    "startMs": 37058,
    "endMs": 38580,
    "timestampMs": 37058,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "They founded the restaurant in Boardman, Ohio, in 1964.",
    "startMs": 38830,
    "endMs": 43450,
    "timestampMs": 38830,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Raffel Brothers.",
    "startMs": 43700,
    "endMs": 45210,
    "timestampMs": 43700,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "R. B.",
    "startMs": 45460,
    "endMs": 46840,
    "timestampMs": 45460,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Arby’s.",
    "startMs": 47090,
    "endMs": 48200,
    "timestampMs": 47090,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "The initials belong to the founders.",
    "startMs": 48450,
    "endMs": 50790,
    "timestampMs": 48450,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "The roast beef makes the coincidence especially easy to believe.",
    "startMs": 51030,
    "endMs": 55250,
    "timestampMs": 51030,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "That’s what makes this a good naming mystery.",
    "startMs": 55500,
    "endMs": 58190,
    "timestampMs": 55500,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "The answer seems to be sitting right there on the menu.",
    "startMs": 58440,
    "endMs": 61550,
    "timestampMs": 58440,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "But the real explanation is standing behind the counter.",
    "startMs": 61800,
    "endMs": 65570,
    "timestampMs": 61800,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Two brothers whose initials became a name millions of customers would say when",
    "startMs": 65820,
    "endMs": 70876,
    "timestampMs": 65820,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "ordering lunch.",
    "startMs": 70916,
    "endMs": 72220,
    "timestampMs": 70916,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Now let’s move from two brothers to one daughter.",
    "startMs": 72470,
    "endMs": 75240,
    "timestampMs": 72470,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Who was Wendy?",
    "startMs": 75890,
    "endMs": 77190,
    "timestampMs": 75890,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "If your answer is “the founder’s daughter,” you’re on the right track.",
    "startMs": 78340,
    "endMs": 82120,
    "timestampMs": 78340,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "But there’s another detail.",
    "startMs": 82370,
    "endMs": 84130,
    "timestampMs": 82370,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Her name was Melinda.",
    "startMs": 84380,
    "endMs": 86130,
    "timestampMs": 84380,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Dave Thomas considered his children’s names before choosing Melinda’s nickname",
    "startMs": 86380,
    "endMs": 90844,
    "timestampMs": 86380,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "for the restaurant.",
    "startMs": 90884,
    "endMs": 92360,
    "timestampMs": 90884,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Wendy’s official history explains that her siblings had trouble pronouncing her name.",
    "startMs": 92610,
    "endMs": 98545,
    "timestampMs": 92610,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "“Wenda” eventually became “Wendy.”",
    "startMs": 98585,
    "endMs": 101060,
    "timestampMs": 98585,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "A family nickname became a restaurant name.",
    "startMs": 101310,
    "endMs": 104250,
    "timestampMs": 101310,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Imagine that transformation.",
    "startMs": 104500,
    "endMs": 106650,
    "timestampMs": 104500,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "At home, it’s a name your brothers and sisters call you.",
    "startMs": 106900,
    "endMs": 110360,
    "timestampMs": 106900,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Outside, it becomes a sign above a restaurant.",
    "startMs": 110610,
    "endMs": 113730,
    "timestampMs": 110610,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Then customers start saying it without knowing anything about the",
    "startMs": 113980,
    "endMs": 117724,
    "timestampMs": 113980,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "family behind it.",
    "startMs": 117764,
    "endMs": 119100,
    "timestampMs": 117764,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "The name sounds like a person because it came from one.",
    "startMs": 119350,
    "endMs": 122740,
    "timestampMs": 119350,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "But the story sits one layer beneath the obvious answer.",
    "startMs": 122990,
    "endMs": 126820,
    "timestampMs": 122990,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Wendy was real.",
    "startMs": 127070,
    "endMs": 128550,
    "timestampMs": 127070,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Wendy was also a nickname.",
    "startMs": 128800,
    "endMs": 130950,
    "timestampMs": 128800,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Now for a name with something you can actually picture.",
    "startMs": 131200,
    "endMs": 134760,
    "timestampMs": 131200,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "You hear “Taco Bell,” and the words seem perfectly matched to the logo.",
    "startMs": 135410,
    "endMs": 139820,
    "timestampMs": 135410,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "A taco restaurant.",
    "startMs": 140070,
    "endMs": 141760,
    "timestampMs": 140070,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "A bell.",
    "startMs": 142010,
    "endMs": 143030,
    "timestampMs": 142010,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "But the Bell is also a person.",
    "startMs": 144080,
    "endMs": 146330,
    "timestampMs": 144080,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Glen Bell founded the chain, opening its first restaurant in Downey,",
    "startMs": 146580,
    "endMs": 151990,
    "timestampMs": 146580,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "California, in 1962.",
    "startMs": 152030,
    "endMs": 153660,
    "timestampMs": 152030,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "His surname is right there in the brand.",
    "startMs": 153910,
    "endMs": 156300,
    "timestampMs": 153910,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Once you know that, the name reads differently.",
    "startMs": 156550,
    "endMs": 159390,
    "timestampMs": 156550,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "It isn’t simply a food followed by a familiar object.",
    "startMs": 159640,
    "endMs": 163470,
    "timestampMs": 159640,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "It’s the food followed by the founder.",
    "startMs": 163720,
    "endMs": 166100,
    "timestampMs": 163720,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "The bell symbol makes the name easy to visualize.",
    "startMs": 166350,
    "endMs": 169640,
    "timestampMs": 166350,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "But the family name gives it another meaning.",
    "startMs": 169890,
    "endMs": 172790,
    "timestampMs": 169890,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "We’ve now found brothers, a daughter’s nickname,",
    "startMs": 173040,
    "endMs": 175890,
    "timestampMs": 173040,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "and a founder hiding in plain sight.",
    "startMs": 175930,
    "endMs": 178350,
    "timestampMs": 175930,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Our last stop takes us somewhere quite different.",
    "startMs": 178600,
    "endMs": 181380,
    "timestampMs": 178600,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "A coffee shop name that leads to a map—and a novel.",
    "startMs": 181630,
    "endMs": 185220,
    "timestampMs": 181630,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Before we reveal this one, take a guess.",
    "startMs": 185870,
    "endMs": 188380,
    "timestampMs": 185870,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Was Starbucks named after a founder?",
    "startMs": 188630,
    "endMs": 191040,
    "timestampMs": 188630,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "A type of coffee?",
    "startMs": 191290,
    "endMs": 192750,
    "timestampMs": 191290,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Or a character in a book?",
    "startMs": 193000,
    "endMs": 194710,
    "timestampMs": 193000,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "The book is part of the answer.",
    "startMs": 195960,
    "endMs": 197990,
    "timestampMs": 195960,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Starbucks’ own account describes a naming process that included the discovery of",
    "startMs": 198240,
    "endMs": 203572,
    "timestampMs": 198240,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "“Starbo” on an old map.",
    "startMs": 203612,
    "endMs": 205430,
    "timestampMs": 203612,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "That brought the team back to Starbuck—the first mate aboard the Pequod in Herman",
    "startMs": 205680,
    "endMs": 210537,
    "timestampMs": 205680,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Melville’s Moby-Dick.",
    "startMs": 210577,
    "endMs": 212040,
    "timestampMs": 210577,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "The name we associate with coffee has a literary and seafaring connection.",
    "startMs": 212290,
    "endMs": 217140,
    "timestampMs": 212290,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "It wasn’t simply a matter of opening a book and pointing at a page.",
    "startMs": 217390,
    "endMs": 221530,
    "timestampMs": 217390,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "The sound of a place name helped lead them toward a character’s name.",
    "startMs": 221780,
    "endMs": 225840,
    "timestampMs": 221780,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Picture the journey on screen.",
    "startMs": 226090,
    "endMs": 228090,
    "timestampMs": 226090,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "An old map.",
    "startMs": 228340,
    "endMs": 229630,
    "timestampMs": 228340,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "The word “Starbo.”",
    "startMs": 229880,
    "endMs": 231420,
    "timestampMs": 229880,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "A book opening.",
    "startMs": 231670,
    "endMs": 233030,
    "timestampMs": 231670,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "“Starbuck.”",
    "startMs": 233280,
    "endMs": 234460,
    "timestampMs": 233280,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Then the familiar coffee-shop name.",
    "startMs": 234710,
    "endMs": 236910,
    "timestampMs": 234710,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "A surprising route to something we now read without a second thought.",
    "startMs": 237160,
    "endMs": 241480,
    "timestampMs": 237160,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Four familiar names.",
    "startMs": 242130,
    "endMs": 243760,
    "timestampMs": 242130,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Two brothers.",
    "startMs": 244010,
    "endMs": 245280,
    "timestampMs": 244010,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "A family nickname.",
    "startMs": 245530,
    "endMs": 247080,
    "timestampMs": 245530,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "A founder’s surname.",
    "startMs": 247330,
    "endMs": 248890,
    "timestampMs": 247330,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "And a trail from an old map to a literary sailor.",
    "startMs": 249140,
    "endMs": 252490,
    "timestampMs": 249140,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "You don’t need to know any of those stories to order lunch.",
    "startMs": 252740,
    "endMs": 255810,
    "timestampMs": 252740,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "But knowing them changes what you notice.",
    "startMs": 256060,
    "endMs": 258560,
    "timestampMs": 256060,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Next time you pass one of those signs, you’ll see more than a restaurant name.",
    "startMs": 258810,
    "endMs": 263290,
    "timestampMs": 258810,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "You’ll see a little piece of how it began.",
    "startMs": 263540,
    "endMs": 265970,
    "timestampMs": 263540,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Which story surprised you most?",
    "startMs": 266220,
    "endMs": 268340,
    "timestampMs": 266220,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "And what company name should we investigate next?",
    "startMs": 268590,
    "endMs": 271750,
    "timestampMs": 268590,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Now you know.",
    "startMs": 272400,
    "endMs": 273610,
    "timestampMs": 272400,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Ordinary has secrets.",
    "startMs": 273860,
    "endMs": 275710,
    "timestampMs": 273860,
    "confidence": null
  }
]
